• Lead organizational budgeting, forecasting, and financial planning , including annual budgets, multi-year projections, scenario analysis, and financial reporting, ensuring leadership has timely, accurate, and actionable information to support strategic decisions and resource allocation;

• Lead and integrate the Finance function , managing the Accounting Manager and Finance Manager, developing staff and managers, and establishing clear priorities, responsibilities, and sustainable workloads across accounting, finance operations, payroll, and related activities;

• Direct accounting, financial controls, and compliance , including month-end close, audits, tax filings, regulatory reporting, financial policies, and internal controls, ensuring accuracy, timely execution, and appropriate oversight of the organization's financial activities;

